  "solution": "Given\n\na = (3)/(7) b \n\n**Calculation**\n\na/b = 3/7\n\na ∶ b = 3 ∶ 7\n\nlet a = 3x and b = 7x\n\n(8a - b)/(2a + 3b)\n\n[(8 × 3x) - 7x]/[(2 × 3x) + (3 × 7x)]\n\n⇒ (24x - 7x)/(6x + 21x )\n\n⇒ 17x/27x\n\n⇒ 17/27\n\n**∴ The value of (8a - b)/(2a + 3b) is 17/27**",
